{# The Schematalog mark, inlined so it takes the page's own text colour.

   Inline rather than `<img src=".svg">` for one reason: a linked image resolves
   `prefers-color-scheme` against the *operating system*, while the page's theme is
   whatever the reader chose - so someone on a light system who picks the dark theme
   would get a dark mark on dark chrome. `currentColor` cannot be wrong.

   The geometry is cropped from the vector on the archive's `logo` branch, and is the
   same shape as `static/schematalog-icon.svg`, which is the favicon and needs its own
   colours because a favicon inherits nothing. Two copies of a mark that changes about
   once a decade; regenerate both together if it ever does. #}
